cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Production-Ready Traffic Sign Recognition (GTSRB)"
abstract: >-
  End-to-end computer vision system for 43-class German traffic sign
  classification: a reproducible PyTorch training pipeline with an auditable
  data split, MLflow experiment tracking, structured evaluation and error
  analysis, and a containerised FastAPI inference service.
